### Oxucular

POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/readers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Arif Qasımov",
  "email": "arif@mail.com"
}

###

POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/readers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Aysel Əliyeva",
  "email": "aysel@mail.com"
}

### Siyahılar

GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/readers
Accept: application/json

### Tək kitab, yeniləmə, silmə

GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/books/{{aqQala.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

###

PUT {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/books/{{aqQala.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ağ qala",
  "author": "Orxan Pamuk",
  "price": 25.00,
  "categoryId": "{{romanCategory.response.body.$.id}}"
}

###

DELETE {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/books/{{aqQala.response.body.$.id}}

### Mövcud olmayan kitab (404 gözlənilir)

GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json